          "filename": "East Point Lighthouse (21666575553).jpg",
          "caption": "The tower is 19.5 m (63.75 ft) tall and was built in 1866-1867.\nBeing at the eastern tip of the island, there is glass all around the lantern so the light can be seen for 360 degrees.\nThe fog alarm building, adjacent to the lighthouse, has been converted into a cafe and gift shop.\nLight: flashing white\n\nFocal Height: 27.1 m (88.75 ft)",
